{"v":4,"catch":"我們走吧。在危險的道路上加速！","desc":"“RADICAL RADIAL”是Nichibutsu在1983年發行的動作射擊遊戲。\n控制輪胎形狀的車輛並駛向目標。\n加速穿越充滿外星人和敵方車輛的危險路線，加速，減速，射擊和跳躍才能通過。\n\n “Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2020-05-21","genres":["動作","射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1185274732396c36f2134aad4e77d74f6f3d89a2a9189c7cbc4134662745dcb2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/595ce1d851441503376f5e82a886a97ef155008bf3c410d9e38b712bc82a73d5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ce7078534de2d7ef6d99195617d048a7f02af51b42c867125a00ab71050170f9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/80224683516a2de127e5c1fc03ebcf9705eb857e712031d2eaacc552e8cdf36b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/333696e58e595504c77ba1d943705f62e3c1dc21c54f7225aa84c016597e3f09.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6f1e1f38d4b768401f09708d839a983809c0aaa655523b3c4ce71e639b3bafdd.jpg"],"titleId":"0100a01011b04000","dlc":[]}